        <mxCell id="title" value="SLSA供应链安全成熟度等级" style="text;fontSize=36;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="40" width="800" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Supply-chain Levels for Software Artifacts (SLSA) v1.0" style="text;fontSize=16;fontColor=#6B7280;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="610" y="95" width="700" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level1-bg" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E0E7FF;strokeWidth=3;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="180" width="368" height="372" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level1-header" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#94A3B8;strokeColor=none;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="180" width="360" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level1-title" value="SLSA Level 1" style="text;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="180" width="360" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level1-subtitle" value="Build - 基础构建溯源" style="text;fontSize=14;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="250" width="360" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level1-content" value="要求:&#xa;• 构建过程自动化&#xa;• 生成构建溯源信息&#xa;• 溯源记录不可伪造&#xa;&#xa;溯源包含:&#xa;• 构建命令&#xa;• 时间戳&#xa;• Git Commit SHA&#xa;• 构建产物Hash&#xa;&#xa;示例工具:&#xa;• GitHub Actions&#xa;• GitLab CI/CD&#xa;• Jenkins Pipeline" style="text;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="102" y="280" width="298" height="248" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level2-bg" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E0E7FF;strokeWidth=3;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="480" y="180" width="368" height="372" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level2-header" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#3B82F6;strokeColor=none;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="480" y="180" width="360" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level2-title" value="SLSA Level 2" style="text;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="480" y="180" width="360" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level2-subtitle" value="Source - 受控源代码" style="text;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1E40AF;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="480" y="250" width="360" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level2-content" value="L1要求 +&#xa;• 版本控制系统&#xa;• 经过身份验证的历史&#xa;• 保留构建日志&#xa;&#xa;增强:&#xa;• Git签名提交&#xa;• Branch保护规则&#xa;• Code Review记录&#xa;• 构建环境不可变&#xa;&#xa;示例工具:&#xa;• GitHub (Protected Branches)&#xa;• GitLab (Merge Controls)&#xa;• in-toto Attestation" style="text;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="504" y="280" width="300" height="258" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level3-bg" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E0E7FF;strokeWidth=3;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="180" width="368" height="364" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level3-header" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#F59E0B;strokeColor=none;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="180" width="360" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level3-title" value="SLSA Level 3" style="text;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="180" width="360" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level3-subtitle" value="Build - 强化构建平台" style="text;fontSize=14;fontColor=#92400E;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="880" y="250" width="360" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level3-content" value="L2要求 +&#xa;• 构建服务托管&#xa;• 构建环境隔离&#xa;• 溯源由服务生成&#xa;&#xa;增强:&#xa;• 临时构建环境&#xa;• 无管理员权限&#xa;• 密钥由平台管理&#xa;• 双人审批机制&#xa;&#xa;示例工具:&#xa;• GitHub Hosted Runners&#xa;• Google Cloud Build&#xa;• Sigstore Fulcio/Rekor" style="text;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="280" width="324" height="256" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level4-bg" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E0E7FF;strokeWidth=3;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1280" y="180" width="368" height="364" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level4-header" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#EF4444;strokeColor=none;arcSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1280" y="180" width="360" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level4-title" value="SLSA Level 4" style="text;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1280" y="180" width="360" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level4-subtitle" value="Common - 双人审查" style="text;fontSize=14;fontColor=#991B1B;fontFamily=Inter;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1280" y="250" width="360" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="level4-content" value="L3要求 +&#xa;• 所有变更双人审查&#xa;• 审查记录不可伪造&#xa;• 不允许单人推送&#xa;&#xa;增强:&#xa;• 强制Code Review&#xa;• 审查者≥2人&#xa;• 审查日志公开可查&#xa;• 自动化合规检查&#xa;&#xa;示例实践:&#xa;• CODEOWNERS强制审查&#xa;• Sigstore透明日志&#xa;• Reproducible Builds" style="text;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=Inter;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="280" width="316" height="256" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
